## Project context

This is a **software-tool** repository: a reusable package, not an analysis. Package
identity, language, and lint/test commands live in `tool_config.yaml`. The design intent
and scope live in `docs/_internal/design/`; handoffs are written there as
`docs/_internal/design/YYYY-MM-DD_<slug>.md` (software-tool has no `sessions/`).

